        "| [`core/scope`](subsystems/scope.zh.md) | 按 agent 划分作用域的注册原语 | 库，无 ctx 键 |",
        "| [`llm/llm`](subsystems/llm-streaming.zh.md) | 消息与流式词汇表，以及适配器 seam | `ctx.llm` |"
